","name":"Muhammad Hafizur Rahman"},"message":"Initial Commit\n\nSet up the micro-frontend Angular application for the Digital Marketing Applet.\nIntegrated Angular Elements for micro-frontend architecture.\nAdded core modules for personalization, settings, and digital marketing functionalities.\nImplemented state management using NgRx.\nIncluded Angular Material and Flex Layout for responsive UI design.\nConfigured the project for integration with the Akaun platform.\nAdded deployment scripts for staging and production environments.\nIncluded unit and end-to-end testing configurations with Karma and Protractor.\nOrganized folder structure for src, projects, bin, and elements/.\nAdded .gitignore and .npmignore files for project exclusions.\nConfigured angular.json for multiple applets and shells.\nIncluded Font Awesome assets for UI icons.","tree":{"sha":"2fb71af7322998a61fd264b6c919b3bac97afb65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mdhafizur/digital-marketing-app/git/trees/2fb71af7322998a61fd264b6c919b3bac97afb65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mdhafizur/digital-marketing-app/git/commits/19eaadb21287e2615d71035835006f21230335e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47850184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdhafizur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdhafizur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdhafizur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdhafizur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdhafizur","id":47850184,"login":"mdhafizur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODUwMTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdhafizur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdhafizur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdhafizur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a