n":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rorychatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rorychatt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rorychatt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ivy-Interactive/Ivy-Framework/commits/771fc82d96f9bc5509b59b56cd984c2e0903bc1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T10:12:08Z","email":"40919111+rorychatt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Mikael Rinne"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T10:12:08Z","email":"40919111+rorychatt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Mikael Rinne"},"message":"Filter multi select options while typing and highlight the best match\n\nAdd searchable and searchMode props to SelectMultiVariant and\nMultipleSelector to enable option filtering as the user types. Wrap\nthe options list in CommandList so cmdk can track the active item and\nrespond to Enter/arrow keys. Export filterOptionsBySearch from\nselect-utils to support all three search modes (CaseInsensitive,\nCaseSensitive, Fuzzy).\n\n- Add filterOptionsBySearch function to select-utils.ts with support\n  for three search modes\n- Pass searchable, searchMode, and emptyMessage through\n  SelectMultiVariant to MultipleSelector\n- Filter rendered options in MultipleSelector based on searchable prop\n  and inputValue\n- Wrap CommandGroup in CommandList and move scroll styles to enable\n  cmdk keyboard navigation and preselection\n- Add explicit value prop to each CommandItem so cmdk keys on option\n  value instead of rendered text\n- Add tests for filterOptionsBySearch in selectUtils.test.ts\n- Add multiselect.test.tsx with tests for filtering and highlighting\n\nFixes Ivy-Tendril#2435\n\nPlan 00396\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"550f6cb9825c2bcfe29027fee62d061929a13dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ivy-Interactive/Ivy-Framework/git/trees/550f6cb9825c2bcfe29027fee62d061929a13dd