//github.com/ZiyangLinScality","id":181715492,"login":"ZiyangLinScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCtTCJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/commits/9f845445d17e2bd4abdf2b22dc0357da3f57865f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T21:11:17Z","email":"ziyang.lin@scality.com","name":"Ziyang LIN"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T09:33:23Z","email":"ziyang.lin@scality.com","name":"Ziyang LIN"},"message":"fix(ScalityUI): address review feedback on hash slicing and cache comment\n\n- Guard log statements that slice the deployed-apps-hash to its first\n  16 characters; an empty/missing annotation now logs as-is instead of\n  panicking the test.\n- Reword the configMapExists doc comment so it does not imply an\n  uncached API server read; the controller-runtime client is\n  cache-backed and eventually consistent.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"b47e25692d3e2722b6a496c8f4142a56998aab30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/git/trees/b47e25692d3e2722b6a496c8f4142a56998aab30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/git/commits/9f845445d17e2bd4abdf2b22dc0357da3f57865f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181715492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZiyangLinScality","id":181715492,"login":"ZiyangLinScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCtTCJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/ui-operator/commit/9f845445d17e2bd4abdf2b22dc0357da3f57865f","node_id":"C_kwDOOhs5hNoAKDlmODQ1NDQ1ZDE3ZTJiZDRhYmRmMmIyMmRjMDM1N2RhM2Y1Nzg2NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/ui-operator/commit/97ed51584bc66c11c2bc6c17e22e7508d5992643","sha":"97ed51584bc66c11c2bc6c17e22e7508d5992643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/commits/97ed51584bc66c11c2bc6c17e22e7508d5992643"}],"sha":"9f845445d17e2bd4abdf2b22dc0357da3f57865f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/commits/9f845445d17e2bd4abdf2b22dc0357da3f57865f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181715492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZiyangLinScality","id":181715492,"login":"ZiyangLinScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCtTCJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/commits/97ed51584bc66c11c2bc6c17e22e7508d5992643/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:37:47Z","email":"ziyang.lin@scality.com","name":"Ziyang LIN"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T09:33:23Z","email":"ziyang.lin@scality.com","name":"Ziyang LIN"},"message":"fix(ScalityUI): prevent partial deployed-ui-apps writes during component readiness flicker\n\nWhen a referenced ScalityUIComponent''s ConfigurationRetrieved condition\ntransiently flips away from True (e.g. cache flicker on operator restart,\nor status reset by the ScalityUIComponent reconciler during image\nre-validation), the deployed-ui-apps reducer used to publish a partial\nConfigMap missing that component. A pod whose kubelet materialised the\nsubPath mount during that window would permanently serve the partial\nfile, since subPath does not propagate later ConfigMap updates.\n\nTwo fixes:\n\n* Sort the exposer list in FindAllExposersForUI and the final\n  deployedApps slice. The cache.ThreadSafeStore behind the informer\n  cache returns items in randomized Go-map order; without an explicit\n  sort the rendered JSON''s SHA256 flapped on every reconcile, churning\n  the Deployment template ~3 patches per minute for unchanged content.\n  Sorting also normalises user-provided ExtraUIApps order.\n\n* Gate the ConfigMap write while any referenced component is not yet\n  ConfigurationRetrieved=True, but only when the ConfigMap already\n  exists (a fresh install has no previous full state to protect, and\n  gating it would block downstream reducers indefinitely). The wait\n  window is bounded per-component by a 60s cap, after which the\n  reducer falls through and writes whatever components are ready so a\n  permanently-broken component cannot block the entire UI.\n\nThe first-seen-not-ready timestamp is tracked in-memory on the\nreconciler keyed by uiName/componentNamespace/componentName. Operator\nrestart resets the timer (granting a fresh wait window). Entries are\ngarbage-collected each reconcile when the corresponding component\nbecomes ready, and on CR deletion via IsNotFound.\n\nAlso adds an INFO log when the deployed-apps-hash actually changes\n(old vs new) to make future ConfigMap churn investigations cheap.\n\nTests cover: deterministic ordering, filter correctness, the\nflicker-then-recovery scenario, the cap fall-through, the\nfresh-install no-gate path, and the CR-deletion cleanup.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"6fdfaea8e74268aa6cb9ca3243c189d856319723","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/git/trees/6fdfaea8e74268aa6cb9ca3243c189d856319723"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/git/commits/97ed51584bc66c11c2bc6c17e22e7508d5992643","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181715492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZiyangLinScality","id":181715492,"login":"ZiyangLinScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCtTCJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/ui-operator/commit/97ed51584bc66c11c2bc6c17e22e7508d5992643","node_id":"C_kwDOOhs5hNoAKDk3ZWQ1MTU4NGJjNjZjMTFjMmJjNmMxN2UyMmU3NTA4ZDU5OTI2NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/ui-operator/commit/8b91717dbdc2110b56d50f4c65917066bd4ce577","sha":"8b91717dbdc2110b56d50f4c65917066bd4ce577","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/commits/8b91717dbdc2110b56d50f4c65917066bd4ce577"}],"sha":"97ed51584bc66c11c2bc6c17e22e7508d5992643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/commits/97ed51584bc66c11c2bc6c17e22e7508d5992643"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181715492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZiyangLinScality","id":181715492,"login":"ZiyangLinScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCtTCJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/commits/8b91717dbdc2110b56d50f4c65917066bd4ce577/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T13:19:47Z","email":"ziyang.lin@scality.com","name":"Ziyang LIN"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T14:11:47Z","email":"ziyang.lin@scality.com","name":"Ziyang LIN"},"message":"fix(ScalityUIComponent): skip status update when validation condition unchanged\n\nAvoid a tight reconcile loop: when validation fails repeatedly with the\nsame error, Status().Update() triggers an immediate watch event that\nbypasses the intended 30s RequeueAfter. Only update status when the\ncondition actually changes (first failure or different error message).\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"403f57dfcd6da7f26ce5ad30cffaaf0fda6b0496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/git/trees/403f57dfcd6da7f26ce5ad30cffaaf0fda6b0496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/git/commits/8b91717dbdc2110b56d50f4c65917066bd4ce577","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181715492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZiyangLinScality","id":181715492,"login":"ZiyangLinScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCtTCJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}",