"ziyang.lin@scality.com","name":"Ziyang LIN"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T14:11:47Z","email":"ziyang.lin@scality.com","name":"Ziyang LIN"},"message":"fix(ScalityUIComponent): don''t stamp lastFetchedImage on validation failure\n\nDuring upgrades with pre-existing deployments (e.g., metalk8s-ui adopted\nfrom salt), a rolling update race condition can occur: the operator\nfetches config from an old pod that lacks required fields (e.g.,\npublicPath), validation fails, and lastFetchedImage is stamped to the\nnew image tag. This prevents retries, permanently blocking the component\nfrom registering in deployed-ui-apps — causing missing UI tabs.\n\nBy not stamping lastFetchedImage on validation failure, the controller\nretries on subsequent reconciles (every 30s) until the rolling update\ncompletes and a new pod with valid config responds.\n\nFixes: ARTESCA-17164\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"94019ee8b43814ec58271a3d3fe3ba45936a931f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/git/trees/94019ee8b43814ec58271a3d3fe3ba45936a931f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/ui-operator/git/commits/34c8543fc6520548751d9eb0ec56eba3cebd80d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181715492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZiyangLinScality","id":181715492,"login":"ZiyangLinScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCtTCJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/received_events","repos_url":"http