bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T01:39:22Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Add VALORAIPLUS Signature Verification\n\nThis commit introduces a new feature to the VALORAIPLUS Fort Explorer: live signature verification.\n\n- **API Endpoint:** A new API endpoint at `/api/audit/verify` has been created to perform on-chain signature verification of the genesis, Merkle root, and attestation files. This endpoint is implemented in TypeScript and uses `tweetnacl` for Ed25519 verification.\n\n- **UI Panel:** A new React component, `ValoraiplusVerifyPanel`, has been created to display the verification status in a clear and concise table.\n\n- **Explorer Integration:** The Explorer page has been updated to fetch data from the new verification endpoint and render the `ValoraiplusVerifyPanel`. This provides a complete, real-time view of the system''s integrity.","tree":{"sha":"c37ec79ea0dc0247a037f4fa74336cc715c10756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/donadams1969/donadams1969/git/trees/c37ec79ea0dc0247a037f4fa74336cc715c10756"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/donadams1969/donadams1969/git/commits/d7655df67c5c3d3ee43316996b0ec31870febb9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goo