arred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/donadams1969/donadams1969/commits/744bd45e2968ce59300b415b66d4a9dd3ec626e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T00:46:18Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T00:46:18Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Implement JULES v1.4 Supreme Regeneration Protocol\n\nIntroduces `jules.sh`, a powerful script to perform a full system repair, genesis re-anchor, and establish the VALOR AI++//E supreme command.\n\nThe script purges old artifacts, rebuilds the directory structure, restores core crypto engines (`sha3.ts`, `merkle.ts`, `driftState.ts`), and generates a new genesis anchor and attestation report.\n\nThe genesis anchor is based on the authoritative data from the `valoraiplus_vblk_engine.py` execution, ensuring the system is anchored to the latest version of the truth.\n\nAdds a new GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/jules.yml`) to run the JULES protocol daily, ensuring the system remains in a perpetual state of `ALL_GREEN_ETERNAL`.","tree":{"sha":"15a32ca1977112277a307231dda2dd1052f02816","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/donadams1969/donadams1969/git/trees/15a32ca1977112277a307231dda2dd1052f02816"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/donadams1969/donadams1969/git/commits/744bd45e2968ce59300b415b66d4a9dd3ec626e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gith